{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TNGHxyRyDqvmxawSe4F3tw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:29.017531+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TNGHxyRyDqvmxawSe4F3tw","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>项目概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>清华大学-新加坡南洋理工大学全球科技传播双硕士学位项目（Tsinghua-NTU Global Science Communication Dual Degree Master's Program）是清华大学新闻与传播学院与新加坡南洋理工大学黄金辉传播与信息学院共同设立的</span><strong><span>三年制双硕士</span></strong><span>学位项目。</span><strong><span>本项目预计面向全国招收优秀的中国籍在读学生5-10人。</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>“全球科技传播”双硕士学位项目为清华大学与新加坡南洋理工大学联培联授项目，中英文授课。该项目学制3年，其中第1、3学年在清华大学新闻与传播学院就读，第2学年在新加坡南洋理工大学黄金辉传播与信息学院就读，毕业获双方学位。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/rPiawAYPDdv13Vg4ofF99daqiaOZQZKXicicwhxmR0bv2ib2MiaW5icVM6AEb6p5LWLLpc8dKnQtXuiaPSj60cDzicqEYvg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span><span>培养目标</span></span></strong></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>本项目旨在培养对全球科技发展规律有深入理解并具备卓越传播实践能力的复合型人才。 学生将系统掌握新兴传播技术的发展趋势，熟练运用传播手段赋能科技企业创新；同时，深入把握科技知识普及科学精神弘扬的核心路径。通过系统学习，学生将全面提升科技传播实务能力与创新思维，成为促进国际科技交流与合作的高素质桥梁型人才。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><font><span><b><span>学费</span></b></span></font></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>本项目</span><strong><span>中国籍学生</span></strong><span>学费包括两部分：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1、清华大学部分：2万/年*该生总修读时间</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、南洋理工大学部分：根据南洋理工大学当年学费标准收费（参考2025-2026学年的学费总额为43,000新币）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程与材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1.清华大学研究生申请服务系统推免申请程序</span></strong></p><p><span>推免生应按《清华大学2026年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生报名通知》，在我校规定时间内登录清华大学研究生申请服务系统(https://yzbm.tsinghua.edu.cn)完成网上申请。</span></p><p><strong><span>2.教育部推免服务系统报名</span></strong></p><p><span>获得本科院校免试推荐资格，经我校考核获得初步录取资格的申请人，应按我校通知要求登录中国研究生招生信息网推免服务系统（网址为：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/）完成网上报名、缴纳报名费、复试确认和待录取确认等环节。</span></p><p><strong><span>3.申请材料</span></strong></p><p><span>在使用清华大学研究生申请服务系统完成网上报名时，提交以下材料的原件或扫描件：</span></p><p><span>(1) 有效身份证明（二代居民身份证）</span></p><p><span>(2)在学证明（学生证）</span></p><p><span>(3)本科学业成绩单（含学业排名证明）</span></p><p><span>(4)两封专家推荐信：申请人在线邀请两位与申请学科相关的副教授（含）以上职称专家在线填写推荐信。推荐专家按申请服务系统要求，在规定的时间内填写、上传专家推荐信。同时请专家在线完成推荐书后协助妥善保存推荐信原件，待后续接收通知将书面版寄至申请人所申请院系的研究生教学办公室，或将书面版密封（在密封信封的封口骑缝处签字）交申请人寄至所申请院系的研究生教学办公室。</span></p><p><span>(5)语言成绩证明：不低于</span><strong><span>7.0</span></strong><span>分的IELTS成绩单或不低于</span><strong><span>103</span></strong><span>分的TOEFL成绩单。</span></p><p><span>(6)个人陈述</span></p><p><strong><span>备注：</span></strong><span>提交的各类证明文件、证书及申请材料均须为原件或其原件扫描件；其中中文材料须附英文翻译文本。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p><p><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span>010-62795474</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><span><span>xwxyjxb@tsinghua.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p><p><span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/rPiawAYPDdv13Vg4ofF99daqiaOZQZKXicickaUiacKnycQeF6ogmp6GAYWYgrXXmg90ZBO7Uy9Jq564wMyXXkfwSHQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/rPiawAYPDdv13Vg4ofF99daqiaOZQZKXicic9MZOibnNpQa8uhKTibMBlpSlcaX4EUXlr7fmUA60GqBibDB7icdnnDqNicQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"21b3372241650e10b7c796757f5436e41b399122c3e163c4e064a33e2287e268","textLength":1202,"sourceSha256":"b11bb33066ae29ce459056e790e1baa3fa1b8fd7a338c01756283f3b72abd7fe","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-15cacfc1eaf93c8a06e8","title":"2025年清华大学新闻与传播学院-新加坡南洋理工大学全球科技传播双硕士学位项目推免招收2026级中国学生简介","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:29.017531+00:00"}
